C430" w14:textId="6AEBCABD"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Normal" /><w:suppressLineNumbers w:val="0" /><w:bidi w:val="0" /><w:spacing w:before="0" w:beforeAutospacing="off" w:after="160" w:afterAutospacing="off" w:line="278" w:lineRule="auto" /><w:ind w:left="0" w:right="0" /><w:jc w:val="left" /></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="3DD7AABC" w:rsidR="54F267C0"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">Dependencies: This task depends on task 1, 2, 3, and 4. </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="678D1AD4" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t>5 tasks:</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="2B4B2576" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0" /><w:numId w:val="2" /></w:numPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t>Smooth user registration and classification: Restaurants, delivery agents, and customers should be able to register smoothly on the platform and be served with different user interfaces according to their user type. For example, a restaurant should be presented with an efficient and user friendly menu focused on maximizing its sales and end customer satisfaction, while the customer should be presented with an interface designed to increase user retention and time spent on the website, which will also ensure that the customer carries out a transaction via our website.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="7CE8EFAA" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0" /><w:numId w:val="2" /></w:numPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t>Data privacy and security: This will be an extremely essential part of our website, and it will directly relate to a user's willingness to carry out operations on our website. Sensitive data, such as a restaurant's transactions, a customer's address and payment information, or a delivery agent's insurance details and earnings, should only be presented to the necessary stakeholder. All efforts should be taken to ensure that our methods of handling user data comply with all legal requirements and laws, and we should try to go above and beyond recommended security principles. Users should feel safe and secure while using our website.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="0F3F37C2" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0" /><w:numId w:val="2" /></w:numPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">Third party interface integration: As stated in the previous project deliverables, our website will make use of third party services, such as a maps and location API provider and a payment gateway provider. Our software should be written in such a way that these third party systems are integrated into our core website without any hiccups or bugs. Special attention should be given to these areas during testing to ensure that no unexpected </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart" /><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t>behavior</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd" /><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> occurs. Moreover, the previous priority of data privacy and security also carries over here, and we must ensure that the service providers also comply with the same standards we aim to follow.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="074ACFA4" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0" /><w:numId w:val="2" /></w:numPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t>Speed and efficiency: Our website should be user friendly and aesthetic, but not at the expense of usability or user experience. The website should be well optimized, and the code should be written with this in mind. A lot of research in this area points to the fact that many customers would simply not order from an application if they find it to be slow or inefficient. This should not be the case with our application. Restaurants and delivery agents will also benefit from such a website design, as it will help them increase their productivity and optimize their earnings.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="005363B3" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="005363B3" w14:paraId="5C0C88F7" w14:textId="77777777"><w:pPr><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0" /><w:numId w:val="2" /></w:numPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">Accessibility and user friendliness: One of the usage parameters we defined in Deliverable 4 was accessibility, and the website should be designed with that in mind. Very few Indian applications focus on this area, which is very disappointing considering almost 2.2% of Indians are classified as persons with disabilities in the 2011 census. Our website should consider this fact and provide features such as an on screen magnifier, an on screen reader, gesture control, high contrast visibility, text to speech support for those who can't read, and speech to text support for those </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="005363B3"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr><w:lastRenderedPageBreak /><w:t>who can't type. There should also be options to notify other users of any potential disabilities a person may have. For example, if a delivery agent is deaf, the customer should be notified in advance for better communication. Similarly, if a customer cannot walk or uses a wheelchair, the delivery agent should be notified so that he or she will at least try to deliver the food as close to the customer as possible instead of just leaving it at the gate.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="00297737" w:rsidP="005363B3" w:rsidRDefault="00297737" w14:paraId="0B28FC56" w14:textId="531F0199"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri" w:hAnsi="Calibri" w:cs="Calibri" /></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:sectPr w:rsidRPr="005363B3" w:rsidR="00297737"><w:pgSz w:w="11906" w:h="16838" w:orient="portrait" /><w:pgMar w:top="1440" w:right="1440" w:bottom="1440" w:left="1440" w:header="708" w:footer="708" w:gutter="0" /><w:cols w:space="708" /><w:docGrid w:linePitch="360" /></w:sectPr></w:body></w:document>